---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { getPosts } from '../lib/posts';

const [latest] = await getPosts();
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description={`Meet ${SITE.author.name}, the tech futurist behind AIERA, a blog about AI's bright side.`}>
  <section class="page">
    <div class="wrap page-inner">
      <h1>About me</h1>
      <p class="lede">Hi, I’m {SITE.author.name}, and I’m betting on a future that’s bright, automated, and built for human flourishing.</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>Many headlines today present AI as something to fear. Look a little deeper, though, and a far more hopeful story is unfolding. AI is helping solve complex medical challenges, taking on repetitive tasks, and giving us something truly valuable: more time to be human.</p>
        <p>This blog is for the curious, the tech-forward, and the optimists. Whether you work in AI, love following the latest innovations, or simply wonder what tomorrow will look like, you’re in the right place.</p>

        <h2>Why I focus on the bright side</h2>
        <p>As a tech futurist, I follow where AI and machine learning are heading and explore what those advancements mean for everyday life. Technology matters, but its positive impact on people matters most.</p>
        <p>Here’s what you’ll find on this blog:</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="themes">
        <li>
          <h3>Smarter living</h3>
          <p>How AI is improving personal health, wellness, and everyday productivity.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Creative freedom</h3>
          <p>How machine learning tools act as co-pilots that amplify human creativity.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>The new work paradigm</h3>
          <p>How automation can create healthier, more balanced, and more meaningful careers.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <div class="prose">
        <h2>When I’m offline</h2>
        <p>When I’m not exploring the latest in AI, you’ll find me discovering new places, spending time with my family, or tending to my garden.</p>
        <p class="closing">The future isn’t something that happens to us. We’re building it together. Let’s make it a future we’re excited to live in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#newsletter">Subscribe to the newsletter</a>
        {latest && <a class="btn btn-quiet" href={`/blog/${latest.id}/`}>Read my latest post</a>}
      </div>
      <p class="note">The weekly newsletter brings a dose of data-backed tech optimism. Questions or ideas? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose { margin-top: 32px; }
  .themes { list-style: none; margin: 28px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
  .themes li { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0; padding: 16px 20px; }
  .themes h3 { font-size: var(--step-1); }
  .themes p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
  .closing { font-style: italic; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 40px; }
  .note { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--step--1); }
</style>
